45 773.0 Td (Packages: ID|Weight|Value: 1|2|6, 2|3|7, 3|4|8, 4|5|9, 5|1|3  |  W=8 kg) Tj
45 761.0 Td () Tj
45 749.0 Td (CANDIDATE REPRESENTATION:) Tj
