45 257.0 Td (A. DIAGNOSE \(Q6 Exhaustive Search selected\):) Tj
45 245.0 Td (  - 2^n outer iterations; n bit-checks each => n*2^n total operations.) Tj
45 233.0 Td (  - Shared subset prefixes re-computed for every subset sharing that prefix.) Tj
45 221.0 Td (  - No pruning: infeasible subsets decoded before rejection \(wasted work\).) Tj
45 209.0 Td () Tj
45 197.0 Td (B. DESIGN OBJECTIVE:) Tj
45 185.0 Td (  - Prune branches provably infeasible \(curr_weight > W\).) Tj
45 173.0 Td (  - Prune branches provably suboptimal \(best_possible <= current best\).) Tj
45 161.0 Td (  - Reuse partial sums along recursion path.) Tj
45 149.0 Td (  - Measurable target: nodes_explored << 2^n.) Tj
45 137.0 Td () Tj
45 125.0 Td (C. REDESIGN: Branch-and-Bound with Greedy Upper Bound) Tj
45 113.0 Td () Tj
45 101.0 Td (  FUNCTION GreedyUpperBound\(pkgs_sorted, start, curr_w, curr_v, W\):) Tj
45 89.0 Td (      remaining <- W - curr_w | bound <- curr_v) Tj
45 77.0 Td (      FOR i <- start TO n-1 DO) Tj
45 65.0 Td (          IF remaining <= 0 THEN BREAK END IF) Tj
45 53.0 Td (          IF pkgs_sorted[i].w <= remaining THEN) Tj
